---
// src/components/homePage/IdentitySection.astro
---

<section class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden bg-cream-50 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12 items-stretch">
            <!-- Motto Card -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-1 bg-primary-600 rounded-[2.5rem] p-12 text-white flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group reveal reveal-left">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-8 opacity-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700">
                    <i data-feather="award" class="w-32 h-32"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-white/60 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Our Motto</h3>
                    <p class="text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight">
                        Inspiring <br/>
                        <span class="text-primary-200">Excellence,</span> <br/>
                        Empowering <br/>
                        <span class="text-primary-200">Future Leaders.</span>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-12">
                    <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-white/30 rounded-full"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Vision/Values Grid -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-10 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all reveal reveal-right" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary-50 dark:bg-primary-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 mb-6">
                        <i data-feather="target" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Visi Kami</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
                        Menjadi lembaga pendidikan Islam terdepan yang menghasilkan generasi muslim yang berilmu, berakhlak mulia, dan berwawasan global.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-10 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all reveal reveal-right" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-secondary-50 dark:bg-secondary-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400 mb-6">
                        <i data-feather="shield" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Core Values</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
                        Integritas, Keunggulan, Karakter Islami, dan Semangat Inovasi dalam setiap aspek pendidikan.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-10 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all reveal reveal-scale" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-8">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-tertiary-50 dark:bg-tertiary-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-tertiary-600 dark:text-tertiary-400 shrink-0">
                            <i data-feather="check-circle" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Akreditasi A</h4>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
                                SMP ABBS Surakarta telah terakreditasi "A" (Sangat Baik) oleh BAN-S/M, menjamin standar kualitas pendidikan yang mumpuni.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
